### 获取token
POST http://localhost:9801/api/uaa/openapi/token?selectAccount=vben&username=admin&password=123456&captcha=true&grant_type=password&client_id=1001&client_secret=aaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeee&scope=profile,email,phone
Content-Type: application/json

